  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Recently I took a panorama to VRChive, but I could not find it when searching afterward. There's not really a way to filter, or sort based on account or world or anything like that, and since all panoramas are dumped to the same place, it gets lost if you don't find it immediately. It would be great if there was better searching or a redirect to your panos as soon as you took them so they didn't get lost. Maybe include the player's username into the file name, so it's searchable?",
